WEBVTT

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:20.750
OK, Richard. That's terrific.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:25.040
Your pressure is 120 over 75, and that's fine.

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:26.740
Now stand up, please.

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:40.890
Good, it's 122 over 80.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:50.300
Six months ago.

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:52.680
Good. Do you have any back or knee problems?

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:55.160
Nope. I am in perfect health.

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:56.980
What do you do for a living, Mr. Stewart?

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:58.040
I'm a photographer.

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:00.440
Interesting. What do you photograph?

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:05.960
Everything. The American scene. People, places, events.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:14.680
No...I can't remember taking pictures of people exercising.

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:17.380
But don't you think it'd be a good subject?

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:18.020
Sure.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:24.300
I need some good photos for my advertising, Mr. Stewart.

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:25.880
Maybe you can photogragh a class,

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:27.940
and I can give you and Mrs. Stewart

00:01:31.180 --> 00:01:31.880
Anytime.

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:33.980
How about today?

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:34.800
Terrific!

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:49.500
Stretch up...and we're going to go left first ...

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:56.380
2,3,4 ... now switch.

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:05.320
OK, hold to the right.

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:59.600
Left, right. Enjoy it.

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:15.100
Richard, did you go to the Davis Aerobics class today?

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:17.760
Yes, I went to the aerobics class today.

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.100
What is wrong with you?

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.940
Nothing. I am in excellent health.

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:28.880
I have ideal blood pressure. A perfect heart.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:32.980
In other words, I'm in wonderful condition.

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:37.080
Richard, did you go to the aerobics class, really?

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:42.900
And your legs don't hurt?

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:45.120
Hurt? What do you mean?

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:49.900
What about your arms? Lift your arms up like this.

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:53.780
And they don't hurt ot even a little?

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:04.800
You are in great condition. I can't believe it!
